stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Hypothesis
    Hypothesis --> CounterexampleBacked: real failure supports hypothesis
    Hypothesis --> Rejected: no discriminating evidence
    CounterexampleBacked --> RepairCandidate
    RepairCandidate --> Falsification
    Falsification --> Rejected: target still fails
    Falsification --> RegressionDetected: prior law broken
    Falsification --> Admitted: target fixed + non-regression holds
    Admitted --> Manufactured
    Manufactured --> CrossGymEvaluation
    CrossGymEvaluation --> LeverageObserved: same repair transfers
    CrossGymEvaluation --> NewCounterexample: different latent defect
    LeverageObserved --> CanonicalBasis
    NewCounterexample --> Hypothesis
    RegressionDetected --> RepairCandidate
    CanonicalBasis --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
